{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>To guide them on the way.</b> Pointed with a patach, which is like לְהַנְחוֹתָם — 'to show you the way you shall go' (Deuteronomy 1), which is like לְהַרְאוֹתְכֶם; so too here, לְהַנְחֹתָם — through an agent. And who is the agent? The pillar of cloud. And the Holy One, blessed be He, in His glory leads them Himself, and in any case He prepared the pillar of cloud to guide them through it, for through the pillar of cloud they travel; the pillar of cloud is not for light but to show them the way."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:00.966166588Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}